MedSAM2 web app
===============

This app is Apache-2.0 licensed (LICENSE). It runs four ONNX models exported from MedSAM2
and SAM 2.1.

MedSAM2 model weights (CC BY-SA 4.0)
------------------------------------
The app downloads medsam2-image-encoder.onnx, medsam2-mask-decoder.onnx,
medsam2-memory-encoder.onnx and medsam2-memory-attention.onnx (models/medsam2.manifest.json),
converted from wanglab/MedSAM2 MedSAM2_latest.pt (https://huggingface.co/wanglab/MedSAM2,
sha256 c92743b99f00d078bf32a3afcc38aaa9faf1c1692dffe3eaa7a90938c1991060) by Jun Ma, Bo Wang
and contributors (Ma et al., "MedSAM2: Segment Anything in 3D Medical Images and Videos",
arXiv:2504.03600, 2025). Licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).

Modifications: converted to ONNX opset 17 by apps/medsam2/validation/export_onnx.py.
Complex-valued axial RoPE and boolean-indexed prompt embedding are expressed in mathematically
equivalent real-valued operations; all trained weights are unchanged.

SAM 2.1 architecture and code (Apache-2.0)
